u=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
def load(n):return json.loads((u/n).read_bytes())
def main():
 fresh=load('fresh-command-results.json');assert [x['check'] for x in fresh]==['contract','model','source','profile','dependency','inventory'] and all(x['exit_code']==0 and not (u/x['stderr']).read_bytes() for x in fresh)
 inv=load('current-inventory.json');p=load('authority-profile-checks.json');d=load('dependency-graph.json');old=load('types-logic-receipt.json');assert inv['partial_drafts']==81 and len(inv['missing_current_drafts'])==102 and inv['source_owner_accepted_whole_translations']==inv['whole_definition_proofs']==0
 text=(u/'REVIEW.md').read_text().replace('# Validation Receipt: typed candidate review','# Validation Receipt: full partial candidate delivery review',1);a=text.index('## 12.');z=text.index('## 13.',a);diagram=text[text.index('```mermaid\n',a):text.index('```\n',text.index('```mermaid\n',a)+12)+4]
 section='''## 12. Current carrier, consumer observations and delivery DAG

The current catalog has 143 admitted-contract rows and 121 current types. No current type metadata row directly binds the selected Receipt Definition meaning, and no current artifact-type identity names a Receipt carrier. This is an observation of the selected catalog, not a claim that a Receipt representation is impossible. External references and specialized reports can record related structures; each still needs an accepted correspondence map before it can instantiate this exact proposed event, membership and comparison theory.

The current generic Definition/v2 carrier binds Definition meaning. C13's admitted CAL-EVALUATION-DEFINITION-V1 profile evaluates Definition/v1 records using seven checks in collect-all mode and the PASS, FAIL and NOT_EVALUABLE tags. Its retained body remains candidate-unadmitted with authority effect none, distinct from its exact C13 profile admission. The selected profile shape has thirteen required fields. Two pure profile renders preserve input bytes and match the selected human projection. This generic Definition profile does not become a Receipt event-record profile, select immutable storage semantics, or supply accepted denotations for the separately sorted event, occurrence, outcome and comparison carriers.

Three exact primary-consumer paths resolve to existing producer-specific validation reports. The CML07 semantic-closure candidate report records PASS, authority effect none and twenty-five checks. The Artifact Type/v2 report records PASS, none and ten checks. The Craft identity-chain report records PASS, none and twelve checks. Their schemas are distinct producer-report contracts. Reading their byte-bound records and checking recorded summary arithmetic does not run those checks, establish current execution, admit a generic Receipt format or verify runtime consumers.

The CML07 report's recorded candidate digest matches the selected current candidate-set bytes, and its recorded Receipt-definition digest matches this selected Definition. Its retained source-admission and promotion-blocker text belongs to that historical report. The current C29 admission overlay is observed separately and does not rewrite the old report. A recorded earlier live-registry check is not a fresh current-registry check. Related material digests in all three reports remain potential mapping evidence rather than accepted event, profile, validator, input-occurrence or causal-blocker denotations.

The reports expose subject, result, checks, materials, claim ceiling and producer-specific fields. They do not directly provide every scalar or occurrence root field in this mathematical signature. That absence does not prove that referenced materials cannot express related information. The review records exact root-field and material observations and leaves all twenty-eight source-map obligations unaccepted. Event identity, exact reference/digest correspondence, membership completeness, declared dependency endpoints, observations, change-or-invalidation comparisons and separately typed authority/lifecycle states each need an explicit mapping decision.

Twenty-four actual catalog, byte-binding, Definition-profile and recorded-report checks passed. Thirty-seven Definition schema probes include five acceptances; thirty C13 profile probes include ten acceptances. Required-field removal fails the relevant shape. Extra Receipt-instance fields cannot be inserted into the closed Definition record. Unresolved identifiers and overclaimed prose may still pass generic shape. Those acceptances demonstrate the limit of a schema check, not valid event identity, complete evidence, honest assurance, actual Conformance or authority.

Thirty-nine qualification hypotheses include thirty-seven rejected cases. Eighty-nine finite proposed-map frames include eighty-four rejections. Changed exact bindings and forbidden implications fail their authored guards. Missing map obligations, fidelity claims without accepted maps or owner/scope records, collapsed source roles, declared-check omission and claimed actual outcomes fail. Hypothetical complete maps remain proposals rather than owner acceptance. Scoped outside cases demonstrate where a rule stops applying. No bound package validator, canonical or candidate carrier writer, native or live consumer was executed by these profile checks; no authority or new Typed Relation was created.

The separately audited typed stage remains byte-for-byte frozen at sixteen inputs. Its current theory has twenty-four sorts, 164 declarations, fourteen required populations, thirty non-entailment targets and 147 controls. The initial successful shared-token stage and successful source-label correction remain retained as earlier evidence. One first typed-freeze audit actually failed because an open history file included its own pre-write empty hash. Its observation and original manifest are retained. The repaired freeze and independent typed audit passed. This failure is neither hidden nor mislabeled as a Definition, model or source producer failure.

The current inventory freshly evaluates one supplied partial T/I witness for each of eighty-one drafts. The complete scope remains 183 current identities, 189 admitted versions and 201 source files; 102 current identities still have no T draft. Incremental character-span, clause and population totals are checked against the prior Validation inventory. Reachable and joint declared dependency graphs preserve prior edges and add this unit's thirty-four direct uses. Missing counterpart packets and cycle classification stay unresolved. These separately valid witnesses do not prove a common model under accepted shared meanings.

Static-only snapshot reuse passed fifteen adversarial differential checks. It reuses immutable snapshot verification without reusing live repository currentness, skipping per-model evaluation, modifying sealed shared validators or promoting proof claims. Initial author, builder, model, source, profile, dependency and inventory producers completed with actual zero exits. Six fresh read-only checks then completed with zero exits and empty stderr. The full review and delivery seal follow that replay; a separate delivery audit follows the seal. Native Artifact creation must follow that successful audit.

Artifact preparation currently binds six source-only files. Twelve exact local source, schema and pure-projection checks passed, retaining the current C53 meaning overlay separately from historical D51 source posture. Its proposed types distinguish typed record identity, purpose, representation, ownership, provenance and lifecycle from canonical-kind membership and authority. One exact producer/process/version tuple is selected from a set-valued approved origin relation. Assurance levels and their necessary declared support are separate from actual verification, external signature success, execution or correctness. The sibling canonical-representation invariant remains distinct. This preparation has no native Artifact interpretation or model and no owner translation acceptance.

'''
 text=text[:a]+section+diagram+'\n'+text[z:]
 old_sentence='Continue with fresh typed replay and an independently audited frozen receipt before carrier/profile and whole-inventory work. Preserve both successful earlier stages and the corrected current evidence. Complete the six final delivery checks, full review, seal and separate audit before creating Artifact\'s native unit.'
 assert old_sentence in text;text=text.replace(old_sentence,'The frozen typed stage and separate audit, current profile and consumer observations, reachable dependencies, current inventory and six fresh delivery checks passed. Preserve both successful earlier stages, the failed first freeze audit and corrected evidence. Complete the full seal and separate audit before creating Artifact\'s native unit.',1)
 text+='\nActual full-delivery evidence: '+json.dumps({'current_definitions':inv['current_definitions'],'admitted_versions':inv['admitted_source_versions'],'partial_drafts':inv['partial_drafts'],'missing_current_drafts':len(inv['missing_current_drafts']),'counts':inv['counts'],'local_graph_nodes':len(d['nodes']),'local_graph_edges':len(d['edges']),'joint_graph_nodes':inv['joint_declared_graph']['nodes'],'joint_graph_edges':inv['joint_declared_graph']['edges'],'joint_missing_counterparts':len(inv['joint_declared_graph']['missing_counterpart_packets']),'prior_seal_files':old['prior_candidate_files_preserved'],'frozen_typed_inputs':len(old['inputs']),'source_files_current':201,'retained_failed_typed_freeze_audits':1,'native_definition_or_profile_failures':0},sort_keys=True)+'.\n'
 assert len(re.findall(r'^## [0-9]+\.',text,re.M))==13 and len(text.split())>2500
 with (u/'DELIVERY-REVIEW.md').open('x') as f:f.write(text)
 print(json.dumps({'review_words':len(text.split()),'aspects':13,'owner_findings':18},indent=2))
